<p>U.S. President Donald Trump and Russian President Vladimir Putin spoke by phone on Monday for about an hour, discussing the conflict involving Iran and the prospects for ending Russia’s war in Ukraine. Trump called the conversation “very good” and said it sounded like Putin “wants to be helpful” on the Iran conflict.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/TVQWF8e7qovRHjnu4alWOBB_LL42_nHQWfDAHD7kWpKCkLJy6ro_SFFSifoB5V83SD3oVb8-PUxzCJgDSHWcBDfOyXAQGeMZXHBBYw6gsaQv7iLW8oEe-CUNSq1UkLIuUOhdA1JPHqXOHPIWXJdYzfQlM5tKTv2sYBTtUiN4cI1bCZ8RuZfGa_V0FMXVpIf4qrFCLMHGrPY4GkHALEDJGtLVtosLRfs3oXSUdg' alt='President Donald Trump is pictured in a file photo used to illustrate reporting on his call with President Vladimir Putin.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Who started it: Kremlin readouts said Trump initiated the call.</li><li>Ukraine track: Ushakov said the leaders discussed trilateral talks among Moscow, Washington, and Kyiv aimed at settling the Ukraine conflict.</li><li>U.S. stated aim: The Kremlin said Trump reaffirmed Washington’s interest in ending the fighting and reaching a long-term settlement in Ukraine.</li><li>Sanctions backdrop: U.S. reporting pointed to Washington weighing possible easing of sanctions on Russian oil.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Kremlin (Yury Ushakov): Ushakov called the conversation “frank and businesslike” and “business-like, open and constructive,” said both leaders were ready to stay in regular contact, and said Putin thanked Trump for continued mediation. Separate reporting said Putin shared proposals to end the Iran war quickly and described the exchange as “very substantial,” with potential practical significance. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/634304-putin-trump-phone-call/'>RT</a>)</li><li>President Trump: Trump said there was “tremendous hatred” between Putin and Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskiy, but he described the discussion on that topic as positive. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/trump-says-he-discussed-ukraine-and-iran-conflicts-putin'>Al-Monitor (via Reuters)</a>)</li><li>Russian independent reporting (Meduza): Meduza reported this was the first known Putin–Trump call of 2026. It said the discussion covered the Middle East war and Ukraine negotiations, citing the Kremlin’s account. (<a href='https://meduza.io/en/news/2026/03/10/putin-and-trump-discuss-middle-east-war-and-ukraine-negotiations-in-first-phone-call-of-2026'>Meduza</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://japantoday.com/category/world/trump-putin-talk-of-war-and-peace-as-us-weighs-easing-russian-oil-sanctions'>Trump, Putin talk of war and peace as U.S. weighs easing Russian oil sanctions</a> - japantoday.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/634304-putin-trump-phone-call/'>Putin and Trump hold phone call – Kremlin aide</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://meduza.io/en/news/2026/03/10/putin-and-trump-discuss-middle-east-war-and-ukraine-negotiations-in-first-phone-call-of-2026'>Putin and Trump discuss Middle East war and Ukraine negotiations in first phone call of 2026</a> - meduza.io</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/trump-says-he-discussed-ukraine-and-iran-conflicts-putin'>Trump says he discussed Ukraine and Iran conflicts with Putin</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/politics/trump-has-call-with-putin-to-discuss-iran-war-kremlin-says'>Trump has call with Putin to discuss Iran war, Kremlin says</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/trump-says-he-discussed-ukraine-and-iran-conflicts-with-putin'>Trump, Putin talk of war and peace as US weighs easing Russian oil sanctions</a> - straitstimes.com</li></ul>